This research focuses on solving the given biharmonic Choquard type equation \begin{align*}
\begin{split}
\Delta^2u=\frac{1}{|x|^\alpha}*[|u|^{2^*(\alpha)}u]+|u|^{2^*(\alpha)-2}u,
\end{split}
\end{align*}with a critical growth condition, where $\alpha$ satisfies $0<\alpha<2$, and found the standard bounded solution for the given equation.

